This patch fixes ALL 4 RISC-V model exports to working condition.
Two bugs fixed: (1) Missing SetValid() in all models, (2) Wrong type in Nibbler's bv() helper.

================================================================================
BUG #1: Missing SetValid() - ALL 4 MODELS
================================================================================

Root cause: Models created before SetValid() became mandatory for JSON export.
Fix: Add model.SetValid(BoolConst(true)) at beginning of addInstructions().

